      "match": false
    }
  ],
  "patternRefs": [
    "DPK-PAT-2814"
  ],
  "remediation": "Record the licence class the project actually ships under, or stop depending on the component until it is known. Specifically: fix a pom.xml with no `<licenses>` block.",
  "limitation": "It matches a pom.xml with no `<licenses>` block in the parsed pom.xml; it cannot tell whether the package is installed, whether any published version is affected by an advisory, or whether the dependency reaches production code."
}
